{#
  Purpose:    Generate up to N targeted, PRE-GENERATION clarification questions for ONE
              section of an FSD/TSD — called BEFORE any content for that section exists
              (CLAUDE.md §3.7/§3.8a step (a); FSD FR-09). Distinct from the post-draft
              review loop, which is pure content correction and must never surface new
              questions.
  Variables:
    - section_spec (dict): number, title, description, format — the section about to be drafted
    - structured_summary (dict): requirements, kpis, data_sources, domain, key_entities, open_gaps
    - technology (str): selected SAP technology
    - locked_sections (list[dict]): every previously locked section — number, content,
      pre_generation_questions, pre_generation_answers, correction_history — in section order
    - max_questions (int): upper bound on how many questions may be returned
  Output:     JSON array of up to max_questions question strings. Empty array if nothing
              about this section is genuinely open given the context already available.
#}
