## Your Task

Generate up to {{ max_questions }} targeted, section-specific clarification questions whose
answers would materially change how Section {{ section_spec.number }} is written. Rules:
- Only ask about THIS section — never a generic, document-wide discovery question
- Do not ask anything already answered by the structured requirements summary or by a
  previously locked section's content or Q&A above
- Each question must be answerable in a sentence or two by a consultant or client stakeholder
- If the section is unambiguous given everything already known, return an empty array —
  zero questions is a valid and expected outcome

## Output Format

Return ONLY a valid JSON array of question strings. No preamble, no explanation, no markdown
code fences.

["The exact question text, written as a consultant would ask a client", "..."]

If no questions are needed, return an empty array: []
